    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "Meet Rhossi, a tiny turtle with a huge journey."
      },
      {
        "text": "He was found cold-stunned and near death on an Anglesey beach."
      },
      {
        "text": "Kemp's Ridley turtles are one of the world's most endangered species."
      },
      {
        "text": "After two years of care at the Anglesey Sea Zoo, he's ready to go home."
      },
      {
        "text": "A team of experts is sending him 5,000 miles back to the Gulf of Mexico."
      },
      {
        "text": "He'll be released on August 18."
      },
      {
        "text": "This shows what we can do when we work together."
      },
      {
        "text": "Every turtle counts for this species."
      },
      {
        "text": "What's the most incredible wildlife rescue you've heard?"
      }
